===Head to the Parlor Car to join the navigation meeting{{subst:void|<!--103010102-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=trailblaze|location=Parlor Car|update|A new journey is about to begin. Pom-Pom has stated in the group chat that they want to stress "three things" during this navigation meeting. Given that the conductor rarely leaves people in suspense, perhaps you can mull over what they are thinking and play the role of the stern conductor's straight man for the navigation meeting.<br />Find a suitable place in the Parlor Car to wait for everyone to arrive.}}
{{Dialogue Start}}
:'''(Trailblazer):''' (Time to head to the next stop. Let's meet up with everyone in the Parlor Car...)
;(По прибытии на место)

;(По прибытии на место)
:'''(Trailblazer):''' (Time to head to the next stop. Let's meet up with everyone in the Parlor Car...)
:'''March 7th:''' Pom-Pom's not here yet?
:'''Himeko:''' Pom-Pom knows how to keep people on the edge of their seats.
:'''Pom-Pom:''' *ahem* Apologies for the delay, dear passengers. Something important came up, so I, the conductor, had to spend some time preparing!
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} So... what came up?
::'''March 7th:''' Yeah! What was so important?
::It's rare for the conductor to make an announcement.
::'''March 7th:''' Yeah! What was so important?
::Are we switching routes again?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} It's rare for the conductor to make an announcement.
::'''March 7th:''' Yeah! What was so important?
::Are we switching routes again?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Are we switching routes again?
:'''March 7th:''' Huh? But I only just finished packing my bags!
:'''Pom-Pom:''' I thought everyone knew! Our next destination is the Planet of Festivities, Penacony.
:'''Pom-Pom:''' I know everyone's eager to disembark and get to that famous stellar hotel, but before we set off, I should remind everyone of three things.
:'''Pom-Pom:''' First: Penacony is located in Asdana, a star system brimming with memoria, which has historically been one of the Macro Voids that leaked out from the Memory Zone. Even after eons, the memoria concentration up ahead is above normal levels.
:'''Pom-Pom:''' Usually, this wouldn't be a huge problem... but everyone's different, so if you exhibit any signs of dizziness, hallucination, distorted memories or any other symptoms, you should take them seriously!
:'''Pom-Pom:''' Second: Penacony is a colony belonging to the Harmony Family &mdash; it also marks the first time this Family has extended a public invitation to other factions. Please remember that the Express has been invited as a guest, and that we must adhere to any and all regulations.
:'''March 7th:''' Got it! When in Rome, as they say! Don't worry, Conductor, we definitely won't embarrass the Nameless.
:'''Pom-Pom:''' Rome? Anyway... Third and final: Rather than being a request... Pom-Pom has a favor to ask of everyone.
:'''Pom-Pom:''' If you could, I hope that while you're all on vacation, you could spare some time to help inquire about a few of the Nameless.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} What Nameless?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Are we getting new crew mates?
:'''Himeko:''' Allow me to explain.
:'''Himeko:''' Just like most of the worlds that the Express calls at, Penacony is one of the stops along the silver tracks. Several millennia ago, it was an IPC frontier prison, and it was the Trailblaze that connected it to thousands of stars.
:'''Himeko:''' During that time, the Astral Express once visited Penacony. As with all meetings, they inevitably lead to goodbyes. As the Express's logs indicate, it seems some passengers decided to call Penacony their permanent home.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Is this a rare happening?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Who could be this important?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} It's been so long. Will we still be able to find them?
:'''Himeko:''' Don't worry, just think of it as returning to your hometown. Following the Express's departure, the {{Rubi|Stellarons|Cancer of All Worlds}} cut off contact to myriad worlds, and Penacony's ownership switched hands several times.
:{{tx}}
{{Dialogue End}}

===Speak with the Crew{{subst:void|<!--103010103-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=trailblaze|location=Parlor Car|update|The navigation meeting has come to an end and the "three things" that Pom-Pom mentioned do not include the Astral Express being able to transform into a giant robot. Though you have to admit this is disappointing, a journey to track a trace of the old Nameless and Penacony itself are enticing enough topics.<br />Before the warp begins, why not discuss your individual plans with everyone? Of course, you could also check in on the newest Interastral Peace Broadcast and see if the Crew can really make the headlines every day.}}
{{Dialogue Start}}

;(Talk to Himeko)
;(If {{cx}}<!--SubMission not Finish: 103010108-->)
::'''Himeko:''' (Trailblazer), you're the picture of calm as always. Meanwhile, March 7th's buzzing around like a kid on a sugar rush.
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I'm excited, too!
:::'''Himeko:''' I trust Penacony won't let you all down.
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Of course, I'm the mature, adult-type.
:::'''Himeko:''' A punchline with a straight face &mdash; I suppose that's your specialty.
::'''Himeko:''' But, regarding The Family's invitation, I do have some details that I wish to discuss with everyone... just not now. Let's enjoy our vacation for now.
;(If {{cx}}<!--SubMission Finish: 103010108-->)
::'''Himeko:''' Let's enjoy ourselves first. Of course, let's not forget Pom-Pom's request either.

;(Talk to Welt Yang)
;(If {{cx}}<!--SubMission not Finish: 103010109-->)
::'''Welt:''' How's it going, (Trailblazer)? All packed and ready?
::'''Welt:''' There probably won't be any surprises happening on Family territory, which is a bit of a shame if you ask me. But hey, it's rare that we can take a break and let loose. Let's enjoy it.
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Mr. Yang, you look relaxed.
:::'''Welt:''' Well, adventures are exhilarating, but rest and recuperation is equally important.
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Mr. Yang, you seem disappointed.
:::'''Welt:''' Of course not! Adventures are exhilarating, but rest and recuperation is equally important.
::'''Welt:''' Rest and recuperation aside, don't forget Pom-Pom's request. The conductor has done plenty for us, and it's time to return that favor.
;(If {{cx}}<!--SubMission Finish: 103010109-->)
::'''Welt:''' Rest and recuperation aside, don't forget Pom-Pom's request. The conductor has done plenty for us, and it's time to return that favor.

;(Talk to Dan Heng)
;(If {{cx}}<!--SubMission not Finish: 103010107-->)
::'''Dan Heng:''' I spoke to Mr. Yang. I'll be staying on the Express this time. I wish you all a delightful time in Penacony.
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} You're not coming?
:::'''Dan Heng:''' Thank you, I appreciate the invitation, but I don't like bustling places, and someone has to handle the work on the Express.
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} You should come with us, it's such a rare opportunity...
:::'''Dan Heng:''' Thank you, I appreciate the invitation, but I don't like bustling places, and someone has to handle the work on the Express.
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I respect your decision. Rest well.
:::'''Dan Heng:''' Thank you, (Trailblazer). It's reassuring to know we're on a similar wavelength.
::'''Dan Heng:''' Pay no mind to the matters concerning the Xianzhou. Penacony isn't the final stop on our trip. We have plenty of time. Once everything is packed up, I will naturally catch up with all of you.
::'''Dan Heng:''' I'd advise double-checking your bags. Word is that The Family's customs procedure can be quite demanding. Better to sort it out now than face issues at your hotel check-in.
;(If {{cx}}<!--SubMission Finish: 103010107-->)
::'''Dan Heng:''' I'd advise double-checking your bags. Word is that The Family's customs procedure can be quite demanding. Better to sort it out now than face issues at your hotel check-in.

